{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03936","headline":"荅宋十一崖口五渡见赠 · 李适","name":"荅宋十一崖口五渡见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君访远山，跻险造幽绝。\n眇然青云境，观奇弥年月。\n登岭亦泝溪，孤舟事沿越。\n崿嶂传彩翠，崖磴互欹缺。\n石林上攒藂，金涧下明灭。\n扪壁窥丹井，梯苔瞰乳穴。\n忽枉岩中赠，对翫未尝辍。\n殷勤独往事，委曲链药说。\n邀余名山期，从尔泛海澨。\n岁晏秉宿心，斯言非徒设。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}